{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nfvh8mAAuPXHuStTpVz3dn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# irt_equated_bench_regen — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 01:28 UTC | 更新原因: D014 plan_004 Step 3 GSM1K 完成 + paper_framing.md 更新\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Pivot 完成 (D011)**：从\\\\\\\"DIF 检测方法\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"LLM benchmark psychometric characterization + DIF methodology\\\\\\\"。ICLR 2027 目标不变。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n**GSM1K 结果 (D014)**：DIF flags 与 contamination gap 显著负相关（r=−0.478, p=0.005）。DIF 不标记 contamination，而是标记 contamination 无法到达的 capability-discriminative items。强化 \\\\\\\"diagnostic lens\\\\\\\" 叙事。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: **Writing**（全部实验完成）\\\\n- **实验**: 12 完成（5 success / 5 negative / 0 failed），plan_004 全 3 步完成\\\\n- **Key results**:\\\\n  - MMLU: semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.508 | cross-subject ΔFPR=0.000 | within-subject C%=38.1% | downstream z=-8 to -49σ\\\\n  - GSM8K: temporal C%=18.9% | semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818 | GSM1K gap r=−0.478 (p=0.005)\\\\n- **Paper Agent**: writing_plan.yaml 审批通过，figures 4/6 完成 + fig_1/fig_4 进行中\\\\n- **审稿**: Round 1 borderline 3.5/6，14 issues tracked\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Agent: 修正 Step 3 report 方向标签（Reviewer CRITICAL）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: 更新 writing_plan.yaml 整合 GSM8K/GSM1K 章节 + 新 figure\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: 完成 fig_1（统一 \\\\\\\"2024-H1\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"2024\\\\\\\"）+ fig_4\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Step 3 正文写作\\\\n- [ ] Post-pivot Dream（Step 3 完成后，写作定稿前评估 ICLR viability）\\\\n\\\\n## Completed\\\\n- ✅ plan_001-017: 10 个 MMLU 实验全部完成\\\\n- ✅ plan_004 Step 1-3: GSM8K cross-benchmark 验证全部完成\\\\n- ✅ 文献调查 22 篇 + experiment_summary.md + artifacts QC\\\\n- ✅ paper_framing.md 更新至 D014（Claim 4 four-layer, Claim 3 cross-benchmark）\\\\n- ✅ writing_plan.yaml 审批通过，figures fig_2/3/A1/A2 完成\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nP0: 250h | P1: 350h | 已用: 0h（全部 CPU analysis）\\\\n无 GPU 需求。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\nICLR 2027（~2026年10月 DDL）— 不降级\\\\n评估: main borderline 5.5-6/6, findings solid 6.5-7/6。GSM1K negative r 不升级为 validated method，但 cross-benchmark evidence chain 显著加强 characterization paper 深度。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-21 | plan_004 Step 3 GSM1K: |r|=0.478 显著但方向为负——DIF 不标记  | plan_004_gsm8k_cross_benchmark, plan_017_downstream_impact |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-21 | plan_017 downstream impact negative 但 informative： | plan_017_downstream_impact |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-20 | Story 定稿：Candidate 1 (benchmark quality tool) + gr | plan_014_within_subject_dif, plan_016_within_subject_semi_synthetic, plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-20 | Pivot 拍板：从\\\\\\\"DIF 检测方法\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"LLM benchmark psychometric  | plan_016_within_subject_semi_synthetic, plan_014_within_subject_dif, plan_011_semi_synthetic |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-20 | 方向 3 (Bifactor) pre-check 否定：within-subject tempor | plan_014_within_subject_dif, plan_011_semi_synthetic |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-20 | Dream #2 分析：best=3/6, median=3-4/6, worst=3/6。跨档一致 | dream_20260520T205007 |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-20 | 方向 2 (IRT θ-conditioning) 失败，1D 路线穷尽。plan_011 abil | plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | Story pivot: semi-synthetic validation 作为核心效度证据，Li | plan_011_semi_synthetic, plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu, plan_001b_matched_ability_dif |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | plan_011 positive: MH-DIF 检测差异性污染有效 (p=0.5 TPR=0.8 | plan_011_semi_synthetic |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | 方向 1 (matched-ability DIF) 失败确认，所有 quintile enrich | plan_001b_matched_ability_dif |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3101, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NnPt9FtudyuHeonHaaWYuQ","session_id":"80d446f8-6835-4587-bd13-fde4c02ffb42","uuid":"c1ab1a39-50e9-4c59-8a78-fd47642a9671","t