{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JpPmxioUX5PHE8BovSQ2AU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"审稿报告已提交。\n\n**结果概要：**\n\n- **R1 (方法+实验):** 4/6 Weak Accept — 认可规模、ground truth meta-critique、cross-subject matching 的贡献，但指出 38% headline 受 capability confound 干扰、ETS 阈值未校准、IRT 拟合差、多重检验未处理\n- **R2 (新颖性+相关工作):** 3/6 Weak Reject — 认可实证贡献，但指出 MH-DIF 无方法论创新、心理测量相关工作覆盖不足、论文过度延展\n- **共识:** 3.5/6 Borderline，Major Revision\n\n**四个 Critical Issues:** (1) 38% 与 capability improvement 混淆未分解；(2) ETS 阈值敏感性分析缺失；(3) IRT 模型拟合不达标；(4) 多重检验未正式处理。最可辩护的贡献是 ground truth meta-critique 和 cross-subject matching framework。建议聚焦 Claims 1-3 + architecture stratification，将 Bayesian DIF、complementary baselines、pilot studies 移入 appendix。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6374,"cache_read_input_tokens":56551,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6374},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80d446f8-6835-4587-bd13-fde4c02ffb42","uuid":"31682334-834e-4289-a8dc-23d63b5dbbfe"}
